<title>UK: WestLB sets index and share warrants.</title>
<headline>WestLB sets index and share warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westdeutsche Landesbank said it has issued American-style call and put warrants, in 41 tranches on the DAX index, the MDAX index and seven German companies.</p>
<p>The German companies included are Bayer AG, Daimler AG, Lufthansa AG, Mannesmann AG, Thyssen AG, Veba AG and Volkswagen AG.</p>
<p>The warrants have a paydate of May 30, 1997 and will be listed at Frankfurt and Dusseldorf.</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
